--- !u!114 &1721331520
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1721331518}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 74c47e3a0cf4baa409a657f200a9f294, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GJ.Game.ReadableNote
  text: 'DAY 5


    The lift shaft. The cage sits on

    its catch at the bottom.


    The
    catch hangs on a chain over

    to a bucket. Fill the bucket, the

    catch
    lets go and the weight

    takes the cage up.


    It never fills in one breath.'
